      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>Tactics</strong> Ghotrag gets his goblins through the breach, uses Rally the Mob, drinks his blurring draught, and then duels the strongest melee combatant. He never flees.</p>\n<p><strong>Blood Frenzy</strong> When he drops below 37 HP, apply @UUID[Compendium.cerabonds-degrees-of-success.icewind-dale-2-effects.Item.eKuecs3aKAuIo41x]{Effect: Blood Frenzy}.</p>\n<p><strong>Loot</strong> 1 extra @UUID[Compendium.cerabonds-degrees-of-success.icewind-dale-2-items.Item.IU3Q0WR9TQE8ouEj]{Blurring Draught}, 3d6 gp (10 gp in his inventory).</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Ghotrag is a huge goblin war-boss and the second prong of the assault on Targos. He leads the rush through the breached northeast wall.</p>",
